Z||000000||Jaei Sun||05-01-2001||06:08 PM||||With my old slave in the system I couldn't DISENGAGE the clutch enough to move freely into gears.  I took it out and found out the dust cover was all full of brake fluid.  So now I got a new slave cyl and put it in and blead the system.  The pedal is nice and firm and moving inbetween gears is a dream but now the clutch doesn't fully ENGAGE!!! <P>WTF?  Anyone else ever experience this problem?  The master is the original GM and the slave is a aftermarket that I pulled off my parts car.  When it was on the parts car everything worked great, shifted just like a really good manual.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://home.mn.rr.com/fierojaei/trans_fiero_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||5
