Z||000003||Jaei Sun||05-01-2001||11:07 PM||||I have a 87 GT with the 2.8 5-Speed.<P>The parts car was a 87 SE with a 2.8 5-Speed.  (same tranny)<P>What boggles me is that the aftermarket slave worked on the parts car (when I had to move it a few times).  The Parts car had the same setup that I have on my GT now.  Original GM master and aftermarket slave.<P>I can't tell if the rod came with AM slave or if it was modified.  But either way it should still work because it worked on the parts car and now it is on the same way it was on the p car.<P>If all else fails I'll make a shorter rod, or just buy a new GM original part.||||reg||4
